    "New wood species, stripped wood, new wood doors/fences/sign variants, modern slab and stair materials.",
    "Fluids retain existing modern state behavior; crops retain the existing lifecycle-specific hardness adapter.",
    "Existing red-sand, minecraft-log-family, ore and functional-block adapters remain explicit modern extensions; they are not broadened by this table.",
    "R196 log metadata 12..15 (all-bark form) is invalid; modern wood/stripped forms are covered only by the existing explicit minecraft log-family adapter."
